{"version":1,"content":"<p>警員朱振國於2005年獨自巡邏時截查青年，遭割傷頸部，因失血過多變成植物人，臥牀21年。</p><p>朱振國上月16日在廣華醫院離世，終年52歲，今（22日）於紅磡世界殯儀館設靈。</p><p>特首李家超、全國政協副主席梁振英、保安局長鄧炳強、警務處長周一鳴到殯儀館弔唁。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T11:41:27.622000+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:06:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:17:59.721537+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:37:43.447588+00:00","content_hash":"9d5e6a1562c88dffee27dc5b010363343c9bb143cc7f3e8cbbf7fb2a6c01b5e1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}